0..77 Comment "// The composite of two paths, the HoTT book\'s Lemma 2.1.2 (`p · q`), at the"
78..160 Comment "// integers: `Path.step(q, r)` joins a path to one leaving its endpoint, and a run"
161..243 Comment "// joins reflexivity to itself. `Path.step(q, r)` is the unbiased composite of the"
244..311 Comment "// 2-chain at its least stratum, `compose[3, 5](chain(2), (q, r))`."
313..337 Comment "// Reflexivity at seven."
